      "title": "Believing Things That Don't Work",
      "gist": "Many people still trust mysticism, ESP, and failing schooling and crime theories, yet no one checks whether they work, and experts' claims leave ordinary people intimidated.",
      "question": "Pseudoscience — why do so many people believe things that don't work? (personal investigations)"
