      "title": "Cargo Cult Science Defined",
      "gist": "Like islanders building imitation runways, some fields copy the forms of science but lack its essential honesty: reporting everything that might make you wrong.",
      "question": "Cargo Cult Science — what essential thing is missing from work that only looks like science? (an analogy and a principle)"
    },
