      "title": "Honesty Toward the Public",
      "gist": "Scientists must also not mislead laymen or officials: explain honestly what work is for, and publish results whichever way they come out, or you are merely being used.",
      "question": "Public integrity — why must scientists be honest with laymen and publish every result? (examples)"
    },
